  "note": "A2 liść · THIRD pack of the Oxford A2 vocab-gap build (VOCAB-BUILD-DIGEST batch 1). Grouping rationale: twelve Oxford-A2 food and kitchen nouns as one theme. Where a2_jobs2 rides inst_identity and a2_places2 rides the locative, this pack rides the ACCUSATIVE — miec_acc has been live since A1 and a1_shopping / a1_freetime already demand kawę, herbatę, zupę, muzykę, grę — so the pack introduces ZERO structures. teaches_structures is [] by construction. a1_food and a2_food2 already own chleb, mleko, kawa, herbata, woda, piwo, wino, zupa, ser, ryż, mięso, jajko, masło, cukier, sok, sałatka, kurczak, deser, obiad, śniadanie, kolacja, danie, napój, talerz, widelec, nóż, łyżka, filiżanka, kubek, szklanka, butelka — ANCHORS here, never re-taught. Judgment calls, all reported: (1) FOUR ACCUSATIVE FORMS are taught explicitly as whole Lubię / Kupuję phrases in block 2, so every form a sentence demands appears in a block and in teaches_lemmas. The block deliberately mixes the feminines that DO change (fasolę, wołowinę, cytrynę, miskę) with a masculine inanimate and a plural that do NOT (olej, frytki) — the contrast is the point, and both halves are already-taught behaviour, not new rules. (2) THREE ADJECTIVES WERE WANTED AND REFUSED BY THE POOL: żółta for cytryna (only żółty is taught), słodkie for ciastko (only słodka/słodki), gorące for frytki (only gorąca/gorący/gorąco). Every one is a gender form of an adjective whose citation form IS taught — the same trap that caught stare in a2_places2. Sentences were rewritten around taught forms rather than the forms being smuggled in. (3) przepis is glossed 'recipe (for cooking)' because it also means a regulation, and because a2_health2 already teaches recepta ('prescription'), which an English speaker will want to map onto 'recipe'. The gloss has to do that work. (4) orzech gets one sentence rather than two: every natural second frame for it needed either a plural (orzechy) or a locative (w torcie, w misce) that is taught nowhere, and inventing one to pad the pack would have cost a form. (5) 'Mamy nowy piekarnik.' uses mamy as the VERB, which is how a1_miec teaches it — the AGENTS.md homograph example (mamy as the genitive of mama) is the reading this pack does NOT use. (6) Icons kept to the Emoji-1.0 set (🍋 🍟 🍪) after a2_countries' note that a newer sequence failed to render on Win10.",
